OL,3,GNEWSANHS winter jab drive gets under
OL,4,Away across London
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,700 community venues across
OL,7,FLondon have begun hosting vaccination
OL,8,Fclinics as part of the NHS's Big Week
OL,9,Fto help eligible Londoners get their
OL,10,Fjabs ahead of winter.
OL,12,FThe big push comes as the UK Health
OL,13,FSecurity Agency warns there are at
OL,14,Fleast two different strains of flu
OL,15,Fcirculating in the UK this year which
OL,16,Fcan make some people seriously ill.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
