OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANHS winter jab drive gets under
OL,4,Away across London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe free NHS vaccines being offered
OL,7,Fwill help protect against viruses
OL,8,Fincluding flu, Covid-19 and pneumonia
OL,9,Fand will be administered as a walk-in
OL,10,Fservice to eligible people until 16
OL,11,FNovember.
OL,13,FThe scheme also aims to protect those
OL,14,Fwho face barriers to routine services,
OL,15,Fsuch as those experiencing homelessness
OL,16,For living in deprived communities.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
